SUMMARY:Trans Day of Remembrance: 50 Years of Fierce Love and Solidarity -
  by The 519
LOCATION:The 519
DESCRIPTION:More info: https://www.instagram.com/p/DfYDmemDCWO/\n\nHosted
  by The 519 (https://www.the519.org/)\n\nJoin the The 519 to commemorate
  the 27th anniversary of the Trans Day of Remembrance (TDoR) to honour the
  lives of the Two-Spirit\, trans\, and non-binary siblings we have lost to
  transphobia\, hate crimes\, illness\, substance use\, suicide\,
  misogyny\, institutional and legislative violence\, and murder. 
END:VEVENT
