SUMMARY:[Hike - Beginner] Heber Down
DESCRIPTION:GTA Hiking & Stuff\nHeber Down Conservation is a great spot fo
 r a beginner Hike.\n\nThis is a beginner/intermediate hike. We will stick 
 to mostly flat and paved sections\, although we will be going into the bac
 k trails where there could be mud. We will cover about 8km.\n\n**THIS HIKE
  STARTS AT 9:30AM**\n\nBring a water bottle and dress for the weather.\n\n
 Parts of the trail can get muddy. Be prepared.\n\nWe are going to meet at 
 the Old Cullen Gardens. Intersection Cochrane & Taunton.\n\nGo to the back
  of the gravel parking lot near the new Pickleball courts. The path starts
  to the left of the picnic shelter.\n\n**Hike leaves promptly at 9:35AM**\
 n\n**LEGAL DISCLAIMER AND LIABILITY INFORMATION:**\n\nBy RSVP'ing and payi
 ng the event fee (if applicable)\, you are confirming that you have read\,
  understand and accept the following:\n\n1. **GTA Hiking Meetup is a priva
 te group**. Attending events is voluntary by you as a member. Participatio
 n in any activity with us is at your own risk.\n2. By joining this event a
 s a member you agree to indemnify and hold harmless its organizers\, co-or
 ganizers\, assistant organizers\, event hosts\, and other members from all
  claims or liability of every type (including court costs and legal fees) 
 for injury or death to any person or for damage to property\, loss of pers
 onal property or any other wrongful act arising out of or relating to your
  participation as a member. This agreement applies to you and to other per
 sons (as your guests) who may accompany you in these endeavors.\n3. You al
 so agree to hold the organizers as well as other group members harmless. B
 y participating voluntarily in the group\, you expressly waive any and all
  such claims against each and every other member in the group\, including 
 without limitation any and all claims against the group organizer\, co-org
 anizers\, assistant organizers\, and event hosts.
URL;VALUE=URI:https://www.meetup.com/gta-hiking-meetup/events/317455034/
STATUS:CONFIRMED
