SUMMARY:UBS at Boulderz 2026
DESCRIPTION:Boulderz Climbing is psyched to announce that we’ll be hosting the University Bouldering Series (UBS) on Saturday\, November 21\, 2026! This scramble-format competition is open to university students. Compete for the title of top school and test your climbing skills in a fun\, spirited environment. \nDate: Saturday\, November 21\, 2026 \nSchedule: \n11am-130pm  \nOR  \n130pm-4pm \nLocation: Boulderz Etobicoke\, 80 The East Mall\, Unit 9 \n\n\nArrive as early as 10am to warm up\n\nPeer-judged competition\n\n\nAwards: 5:00–5:30 pm\n\n\nStudents who register by November 11\, 2026 will receive a FREE T-shirt.\n\n\n\nT-shirts will also be available on the day of the event. Slots are limited and will be allocated on a first-come\, first-served basis. \nREGISTER NOW \nDon’t miss this fantastic opportunity to showcase your climbing skills! All skill levels are welcome\, whether you’re a beginner or an experienced climber. Join us for a day of camaraderie and spirited competition. \nWe look forward to hosting you at the event! \n \nCLMBR ARTS MRKT Holiday Market 1pm-4pm  will be happening during the UBS Competition\, so come out for a fun time!\nSupport small businesses from your local climbing communities
URL:https://boulderzclimbing.com/event/ubs-at-boulderz-2026/
LOCATION:Etobicoke\, 80 The East Mall Unit 9\, Etobicoke\, Ontario\, M8Z 5X1\, Canada
CATEGORIES:Competition
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/png:https://boulderzclimbing.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/UBS-logo-scaled.png
ORGANIZER;CN="Boulderz Etobicoke":MAILTO:etobicokebooking@boulderzclimbing.com
END:VEVENT
