SUMMARY:Etobicoke Tenant School - by Federation of Metro Tenants'
  Associations
LOCATION:Location for participants who register
DESCRIPTION:More info:
  https://www.torontotenants.org/etobicoke_tenant_school_november_21_regist
 ration_is_now_open\n\nHosted by Federation of Metro Tenants' Associations
  (https://www.torontotenants.org/)\n\nTenants and Tenant Association
  leaders in Etobicoke are welcome to participate in the Tenant School!
