UID:10425943-1795291200-1795312800@golatindance.com
SUMMARY:I Like It Like That Satudays
DESCRIPTION:An evening of fine dancing with top London maestros spinning the finest salsa on vinyl! Veteran talented Djs\, who have been playing the best salsa for decades at the best venues in London will be returning to our decks! Tony Crossbody\, Johnny Gee and our host Erick the Saint will be playing for your dancing pleasure.\nThe night will open with 1.5 hrs of salsa classes to add more energy to the beginning of the night and warm up dancers for the flavour to come!\nPremium salsa in premium surround sound in a beautiful\, large\, art deco town hall with fantastic wooden dance floor for your dancing pleasure. Fully air conditioned\, relaxed\, welcoming\, quality venue with a separate bar area with cheap drinks\, in the heart of Brixton high street\, 2 minutes away from 24hr night tube (Victoria Line).\n★★★★♬♪♩★★★★★★★★★★★★★★★★★★★★★★\nDOORS OPEN: 7.50pm\nCLASSES: 8pm – 9.30pm\nPARTY: 9.30pm – 2am\nLAST ENTRY @ 1am\nBrixton tube station is two minutes walk from the venue with night tube in operation with Victoria line on the weekends.\nVENUE:\nLambeth Town Hall\n1 Brixton Hill\, Brixton\,\nLondon SW2 1RW\n(Acre Lane entrance)
URL:https://golatindance.com/event/i-like-it-like-that-satudays/2026-11-21/
LOCATION:Lambeth Town Hall\, Brixton Hill\, London\, SW2 1RW\, GB
CATEGORIES:London
GEO:51.4605256;-0.1161197
