DESCRIPTION:Address:\nTrillium Park\nMeet us at the Fire Pit. Limited park
 ing by the Coronation park.\nToronto\, ON\nCanada\n\nMagical.bingo turned 
 1!\n\nI (Kexin) am ready to retire from this bingo beeswax. Come  celebrat
 e with us. We will be starting a fire at the Fire Pit. There might even be
  marshmallows. Do not feed the seagulls tho.\nThis is an outdoor thing hap
 pening in Canada so dress accordingly.\n\nAt Seagull Counting Club (SCC)\,
  we count seagulls. Bring your pen and paper\, sunscreen and sunglasses\, 
 friends and family (toddlers welcome)\, and let's count to 89.\nThe first 
 person who counts 89 seagulls will be crowned as Counter of the Week (COTW
 ). There is no prize\, but you will get unlimited sunlight (until 4:46…\
 n\nHosted by Kexin Li
LOCATION:Trillium Park\, 955 Lake Shore Blvd W\, Toronto\, ON M6K 3B9\, Ca
 nada
