DESCRIPTION:More info: https://luma.com/5n0mgkvf?tk=8aa8Hw\n\nHosted by
  Technologists for Democracy (https://techfordemocracy.ca/)\n\n​Join
  Technologists for Democracy for our next Film Club selection as they
  watch NAZA at the Hot Docs Ted Rogers Cinema! ​After the screening\,
  they’ll head across the street to Paupers Pub\, where they’ve
  reserved 25 seats. Feel free to join them for drinks and an informal
  conversation about the film.
END:VEVENT
