DESCRIPTION:We invite you to join us for an ‘Applying to Grad School at 
 York: Domestic Applications 101’ session\, to learn more about York Univ
 ersity and our graduate admissions process.\nThis session is intended for 
 applicants who are Canadian citizens or permanent residents. This session 
 will run about an hour\, and will cover “Why York”\, eligibility\, req
 uirements\, financial information\, how to apply\, and more.\nPlease note 
 that during these sessions we will not be able to answer any questions abo
 ut Schulich School of Business programs\, or Osgoode Law School programs. 
 For all other master’s programs\, doctoral programs\, and graduate diplo
 mas\, this is the session for you!\nRegistration is required. To RSVP or l
 earn more\, visit yorku.zoom.us/meeting/register ( https://yorku.zoom.us/w
 ebinar/register/WN_t2tLK4oTTYCZLGrsclZhXA ).\nLearn more about our graduat
 e programs at futurestudents.yorku.ca/graduate/programs ( http://futurestu
 dents.yorku.ca/graduate/programs )\nFor any questions\, please email us at
  FGSAPPLY@YORKU.CA.\n
