SUMMARY:More-than-Human Geographies: Shuar science from the Ecuadorian Ama
 zon and Indigenous-led conservation for greater planetary health
DTSTART:20261124T190000Z
DTEND:20261124T200000Z
DTSTAMP:20261109T182300Z
UID:MEC-9802a535bbdbcec203871db6d9595586@events.yorku.ca
