BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE-URLS:{"Events": "https://reconline.yorkulions.ca/Program/GetProgramDetails?courseId=12f937c9-4e5a-48f9-9fed-aaf9ffffbb0b"}
X-SOURCE-ID:events
SUMMARY:5K Walk or Run
DTSTART:20261124T194500Z
DTEND:20261124T210000Z
DTSTAMP:20261102T163800Z
UID:MEC-4b0cb9685dd1da13cd7d85b3e4de824f@events.yorku.ca__20261124
SEQUENCE:5
CATEGORIES:Markham Athletics &amp\; Recreation,Markham Campus
CLASS:PUBLIC
CREATED:20261102
DESCRIPTION:This program is being offered at the Markham Campus\nThe 5K 
 Walk or Run is a seasonal\, guided outdoor program designed to help you s
 tay physically active\, reduce stress\, and connect with the Markham Campu
 s community. Whether you want to achieve a continuous 5K run or enjoy a ca
 sual\, low-pressure group walk\, this program is structured to support all
  activity levels!\nEach week\, A&R staff guides will lead participants thr
 ough our local scenic trail loop (Mildred Temple Park). View the trail map
  displayed below on this page to preview our route!\nWEATHER POLICY: This
  is a strictly outdoor program. In the event of an official weather adviso
 ry or unsafe trail conditions\, the session will be cancelled ahead of tim
 e. Registered participants will receive an email notification regarding ca
 ncellations.\n\nTuesdays from 2:45pm – 4:00pm (Check-in and warm-up beg
 in at 2:45pm\; Trail departure is sharp at 3:00pm)\nFirst Class: September
  15th\, 2026\nLast Class: November 24th\, 2026\n\nNote: Classes do not run
  on Statutory Holidays or during University Reading Weeks.\nWe ask that yo
 u arrive right at 2:30pm as you will need to complete the check-in process
  and warm-up with staff at the desk before the group hits the trail at 2:4
 5pm.\n
LAST-MODIFIED:20261102
LOCATION:Markham Campus (MK2050)
ORGANIZER;CN="Stephanie Valdez":MAILTO:svaldez@yorku.ca
PRIORITY:5
TRANSP:OPAQUE
URL:https://reconline.yorkulions.ca/Program/GetProgramDetails?courseId=12f
 937c9-4e5a-48f9-9fed-aaf9ffffbb0b
X-SOURCE:York University
END:VEVENT
