CREATED:20260928
DESCRIPTION:The Faculty of Graduate Studies is hosting a session entitled 
 Getting Unstuck: Tips for Moving Forward with Your Research. Join us!\nRes
 earch rarely progresses in a straight line. Graduate students often encoun
 ter moments of uncertainty\, competing priorities\, stalled projects\, or 
 challenges maintaining momentum over the course of their degree. This sess
 ion explores practical approaches for planning\, prioritizing\, and moving
  research forward when challenges arise. Participants will learn strategie
 s for breaking complex projects into manageable steps\, developing sustain
 able research habits\, and maintaining progress throughout the graduate jo
 urney.\nDate: Wednesday November 25\, 2026\nTime: 12:00-1:00 p.m. (ET)\nLo
 cation: Virtual Workshop via Zoom Webinar\nRegistration is required: Regis
 tration Form ( https://yorku.zoom.us/webinar/register/WN_7IhjteccQV6GUwruc
 lx5cQ )\n
