 ate meaningful discussions\, peer learning\, and high-quality connections 
 among operators building and scaling products today.\nWe'll explore topics
  such as:\nProduct-led growth and acquisition strategies\nAI's impact on g
 rowth\, pricing\, and monetization\nRetention\, activation\, and customer
