DESCRIPTION:OPEN TO: ALL STUDENTS\n\nJoin our information session to get t
 he INSIDE SCOOP on Canada’s top marketing competition.\n\nDATE: Wednesda
 y\, November 25th\nTIME: 5:30 – 7 PM\nLOCATION: Room W136\n \nREGISTRAT
 ION LINK:\nCanadian Marketing League (CML) is Canada’s largest marketing
  competition\, designed for students who seek achievement beyond the class
 room. It’s an ideal playground for marketing athletes hungry to prove th
 emselves – those committed\, driven\, and ready to play in the big leagu
 es.\nWhy should you compete in CML?\nCML partners with best-in-class organ
 izations like Microsoft\, Kraft Heinz\, Environics Analytics\, General Mot
 ors\, and more to offer $20\,000 in prizing and exclusive internship along
  with full-time career opportunities to students participating from across
  the country. With the learning partners integrated throughout the competi
 tion\, through case challenges\, workshops\, and mentorships\, you’re ab
 le to learn every step of the way. Hungry to get involved? Built like a sp
 orts league\, the regular season case will go live in mid-November! Test y
 our analytical\, strategic\, and creativity skills. Let the anticipation b
 egin!\n\nWhat are you waiting for?\nGame’s back. Swing by our booth on N
 ovember 25th from 9-5 in the North Lobby of the Schulich building as our t
 eam would love to chat with you or join our information session from 5:30-
 7pm to learn more about the competition\, by signing up here. Make sure to
  also sign up for our mailing list to stay in the loop: https://www.market
 ingleague.ca/register ( https://www.marketingleague.ca/register )\n\nREGIS
 TER HERE:\nhttps://www.eventbrite.com/e/canadian-marketing-league-cml-info
 rmation-session-on-campus-tickets-2004960619184?aff=oddtdtcreator ( https:
 //www.eventbrite.com/e/canadian-marketing-league-cml-information-session-o
 n-campus-tickets-2004960619184?aff=oddtdtcreator )\n
LAST-MODIFIED:20261120
