SUMMARY:Threads of Hope: Crochet for a Cause (16 Days of Activism)
DTSTART:20261125T223000Z
DTEND:20261126T003000Z
DTSTAMP:20261118T135100Z
UID:MEC-7d3d99bab1c841a23a2d7b50ebd7b7bb@events.yorku.ca
RECURRENCE-ID:20261125T223000Z
SEQUENCE:2
CATEGORIES:Equity, People &amp\; Culture
CLASS:PUBLIC
CREATED:20261118
DESCRIPTION:From November 25 to December 10\, 2026\, The Centre for Sexual
  Violence Response\, Support & Education joins the global 16 Days of Activ
 ism Against Gender-Based Violence.\nThis year’s theme is “Ensuring Jus
 tice\, Protecting Survivors\, Ending Impunity\,” and our Centre’s mess
 age is that Justice begins with accountability.\nOn Wednesday\, November 2
 5th\, The Centre is hosting “Threads of Hope” in collaboration with Cr
 ochet for Cause. Join us for an evening of crochet and group discussions o
 f hope\, encouragement\, and solidarity for survivors of gender-based and 
 sex. Garments made at the event will be donated to North York Women’s Sh
 elter.\nLocation details will be provided upon registration.\nTo register 
 for this event\, please complete the following form: 16 Days of Activism 
 – Event(s) Registration Form – Fill out form\n
LAST-MODIFIED:20261118
PRIORITY:5
TRANSP:OPAQUE
URL:https://events.yorku.ca/events/threads-of-hope-crochet-for-a-cause-16-
 days-of-activism/
X-SOURCE:York University
END:VEVENT
