UID:6adb9729ebad220045477d98@tpl.bibliocommons.com
DESCRIPTION:Act-ively Preventing Elder Abuse\nwith\nTheatre of the Beat\nL
 earn how to recognize and respond to elder abuse in a safe way with\nThea
 tre of the Beat.\nWith a mix of theatre exercises and presentation\, this 
 engaging workshop will help you develop strategies to be an "active bysta
 nder" in situations where elder\nabuse might be present. No theatre experi
 ence required \, but participation is encouraged!\nLight refreshments will
