DESCRIPTION:Drop-in on the last Thursday of the month for a lively book di
 scussion led by a librarian!\nTwenty Regular Print copies of November's s
 election\,\nThe Lion Women of Tehran\nby Marjan Kamali\, have now been dis
 tributed.\nThis title is also available in Large Print\, as an eBook\, and
  as an eAudiobook.\nUpcoming Titles:\nSeptember 24 - All's Well by Mona A
 wad\nOctober 29 - Prairie Edge by Conor Kerr\nNovember 26 - The Lion Women
  of Tehran by Marjan Kamali\nJanuary 28 - To Be Announced\nFebruary 25 - E
 ncampment by Maggie Helwig\nMarch 25 - The Tainted Cup by Robert Jackson B
 ennett
LOCATION:North York Central Library\, Room 2/3\, 2nd Floor
URL:https://tpl.bibliocommons.com/v2/events/69f603ae596674bcd583e839
X-SOURCE:Toronto Public Library — Older Adults
