SUMMARY: Book Launch: That Directionless Light of the Future\, Rediscover
 ing Russell FitzGerald
DESCRIPTION:Please join us for a book launch of That Directionless Light 
 of the Future: Rediscovering Russell FitzGerald with editor Jon Davies. S
 top by to pick up a copy of the publication and enjoy refreshments and a 
 drop-in signing with the editor. Join us for brief remarks at 6pm.\n\nTha
 t Directionless Light of the Future: Rediscovering Russell FitzGerald is 
 the first major publication devoted to artist Russell FitzGerald. Bringin
 g together newly commissioned scholarship and more than 90 reproductions 
 of paintings\, drawings\, illustrations\, archival material the book offe
 rs the first comprehensive account of an artist whose ambitious vision ha
 s remained hidden for decades.\n\nEdited by Canadian art historian and cu
 rator Jon Davies\, this handsome volume brings together reproductions of 
 the artist’s work and other material with new texts by Davies\, Dodie Bel
 lamy\, and Jamie Parra to return FitzGerald to art history and consider h
 is relevance to the present.\n\nFor further information\, visit our websi
 te. https://artmetropole.com/events/book-launch-that-directionless-light-
 of-the-future-rediscovering
CATEGORIES:Book-Launch,Art-Show/Gallery-Event,Art-Metropole
