DESCRIPTION:Get ready for Fun Friday! Kids ages\n6–12\nare invited to jo
 in us for an afternoon of creativity\, games\, and fun. We’ll have a mix
  of arts and crafts\, games\, Snap Circuits\, and more! Come meet new frie
 nds\, try something new\, and have a great time at the library. There’s 
 always something fun to discover!
