SUMMARY:After School Club: STEM Making a Flashlight
DTSTART;TZID=America/Toronto:20261127T160000
DTEND;TZID=America/Toronto:20261127T170000
UID:6ac9818529c3d600332ee8d7@tpl.bibliocommons.com
DESCRIPTION:Looking for something to do after school? Come out to our Afte
 r School Club and learn new things\, make stuff\, meet other kids and have
  fun! For ages\n6 to 8.\nNovember 13\nPuppetry Workshop\n: Mike Harding o
 f AppleFun Puppetry shows you how to make your own puppets and put on a sh
 ow for your friends!\nNovember 27\nSTEM Making a Flashlight\n: build a wor
 king mini-flashlight science project using a craft stick\, a coin battery\
 , copper tape\, and an LED.\nDecember 04\nDIY Christmas Tree:\nMake a smal
 l Christmas tree to take home!\nDecember 11\nBuild with Tiles\, Straws & L
 EGO!\nUse your creativity to build something!\nDecember 18\nAppleFun Puppe
 try Workshop\n: Mike Harding of AppleFun Puppetry shows you how to make y
 our own puppets and put on a show for your friends!\nSnacks are offered du
 ring the After School Club for participants. Ingredient lists will be avai
 lable. Snacks are generously supported\, in part\, by donors.
LOCATION:Albert Campbell\, Small Meeting Room
URL:https://tpl.bibliocommons.com/v2/events/6ac9818529c3d600332ee8d7
X-SOURCE:Toronto Public Library — School Age
END:VEVENT
