 t is centred around connection and shared experiences. Giving back is als
 o a big part of the experience\, with a portion of event proceeds and 100
 % of funds raised through raffle ticket sales going towards the Let's Cur
 e Lucas Foundation to support Lucas and his family.\n\n\nTickets for the 
