SUMMARY: Live Taping: Tom Hearn’s Barefooting Through The Snow
DESCRIPTION:Barefooting Through The Snow is a festive love letter to Ina 
 Garten and all things holislay! Comedian Tom Hearn brings his celebrity i
 mpressions and original characters to life in this holiday comedy spectac
 ular. Get into the spirit with Ina's iconic Christmas Cosmopolitan\, rece
 ive gift-giving advice from Martha Stewart\, see improvised holiday movie
  magic with James Corden\, and enjoy original sketches\, musical numbers 
 and lots more guaranteed to make the yuletide gay.\n\nTom Hearn (@isthatt
 omhearn) is a comedian and actor splitting his time between New York City
  and Toronto. Named a 2025 Just For Laughs New Face of Comedy\, he has bu
 ilt a following of over 700K and more than 150 million views online. His 
 viral impressions have been featured by NBC’s Today Show\, Food Network\,
  the BBC\, and more. He was also named one of ET Canada’s “Best TikTok Cr
 eators To Follow.”\n\nGet your tickets before it’s too late:\ncomedybar.c
 a/shows/barefooting-through-the-snow-bloor?ev=2026-11-29T21%3A00%3A00 htt
 ps://comedybar.ca/shows/barefooting-through-the-snow-bloor?ev=2026-11-29T
 21%3A00%3A00
