UID:6ad7f407de300e00451bc129@tpl.bibliocommons.com
DESCRIPTION:November is Make a Will Month and TPL is delighted to host the
  Ontario Bar Association. Learn about the importance of having a will and 
 powers of attorney for you and your family. A member of the\nOntario Bar A
 ssociation\nwho practices Trusts and Estates Law will speak about the elem
 ents of a will\, what happens if you don’t have one\, what are powers of
  attorney\, why they are important and special considerations to keep in m
 ind when preparing your estate and care plans.\nNote\, this program is for
  general information only\, not for drafting individual wills.\n(Registrat
 ion required. Drop-ins welcome if space permits.)\nInformation Collection 
 Notice:\nThe personal information on this form is collected by the Toronto
