DTEND;TZID=America/Toronto:20261201T210000
UID:evt-EsMUAoexW00jN2u@events.lu.ma
DESCRIPTION:Address:\nCheck event page for more details.\n\nmade merry... 
 the well connected club holiday social. this year we’re making something
  and giving something back (it’s giving tuesday after all!).\nwe’re ba
 ck with tigerbaby\, who we made pottery with in april\, and this time we
 ’re painting ornaments. three each\, to be exact.\nyou’ll paint yours\
 , sarah’s team fires them\, and they’ll be ready to pick up from tiger
 baby in time to hang before the holidays. keep all three\, or gift a coupl
 e. you’ll hang them every year\, even if they turn out a little wonky.\n
 we’ll start with a quick round and prompt so everyone knows who’s in t
