DESCRIPTION:Join the Women in Law Association (WILA) and The Centre for a 
 panel discussion exploring the barriers and challenges survivors face when
  navigating the legal system. This discussion will examine the realities o
 f seeking justice for survivors of sexual assault\, including the systemic
  obstacles\, challenges and experiences of revictimization they may encoun
 ter throughout the legal process.\nDate: Tuesday\, December 1\nTime: 5:30 
 – 8 p.m.\nLocation: Hybrid. The in-person location for this event will b
 e provided upon registration.\nRegister to join\n
