SUMMARY:Movie Night: Watch\, Reflect\, Connect
DTSTART:20261203T220000Z
DTEND:20261204T010000Z
DTSTAMP:20261119T162200Z
UID:MEC-99f4a5fef7b45624924eb900758be690@events.yorku.ca
RECURRENCE-ID:20261203T220000Z
SEQUENCE:3
CATEGORIES:16 Days of Activism,Students,The Centre
CLASS:PUBLIC
CREATED:20261119
DESCRIPTION:Lights\, Camera\, Conversation! \nJoin us for a community mov
 ie night where we’ll be screening Barbie (2023) as part of the 16 Days o
 f Activism. Through storytelling and shared reflection\, this screening in
 vites participants to explore themes of resilience\, empowerment and the i
 mportance of creating safer\, more supportive communities. Following the f
 ilm\, attendees will have the opportunity to engage in informal discussion
  and connect with resources that support learning\, advocacy and action. 
 \nDate: Thursday\, December 3\nTime: 5 – 8 p.m.\nLocation: Hybrid. The i
 n-person location for this event will be provided upon registration. This 
 event will also be streamed online so that folks from all campuses can joi
 n in! \nClick here to register \n
LAST-MODIFIED:20261119
PRIORITY:5
TRANSP:OPAQUE
URL:https://events.yorku.ca/events/movie-night-watch-reflect-connect/
X-SOURCE:York University
END:VEVENT
