DESCRIPTION:Add a little extra sparkle to your season with a fun\, hands-o
 n creative adventure!  Join us for a 3D Paper Snowflake Workshop\, where 
 you'll learn how to transform simple sheets of paper into beautiful\, eye-
 catching snowflakes that are anything but ordinary.  Best of all\, you'll
  get to take your finished snowflakes home to hang\, display and decorate 
 with\, all season long!\nPlease register.
