DESCRIPTION:Get ready for the holidays by painting ornaments and beautiful
  cards for your friends and family! We'll have ball ornaments\, blank flat
  wooden ornaments\, and paper for painting watercolour or acrylic holiday
  cards available. Join your neighbours and make some holiday keepsakes to
  treasure year after year!\nOther activities\, such as colouring and board
  games\, are always available at our Friday Crafts sessions. Come have fun
  and meet some new people from your community!\nAll materials provided. D
 rop in.
