DESCRIPTION:Introducing Don Mills Youth Hub’s first ever Social Night! T
 he weather is getting chilly\, so wear your PJs\, bring a blanket\, and co
 zy up by the fire for a movie with friends. Be sure to stop by our photo b
 ooth\, too.\nAre we watching an action-packed adventure\, a cheesy rom-com
 \, or an uproariously funny comedy? Vote for your favourite movie in the Y
 outh Hub. We’ll show the film with the most votes.\nWe will also have a 
 selection of special snacks only available during this program.\nThis is a
  drop-in Youth Hub program for\nteens only.\nNo registration required.\nTh
 is program is part of Youth Hub service. Youth Hubs are a welcoming place 
