SUMMARY: 13th Annual Leslieville Christmas Pop-up Market
DESCRIPTION:"Something Holiday for Everyone! " CP24 Testimonial\n\nCelebr
 ate the magic of the holiday season at the 13th Annual Leslieville Christ
 mas Pop-up Market\, one of Toronto’s beloved east-end holiday traditions!
 \n\nFor three festive days\, we’re bringing together an incredible collec
 tion of local artisans\, artists\, designers\, food creators and beverage
  distillers/brewers under one roof. Discover unique gifts\, beautiful hol
 iday décor\, specialty foods\, fashion\, jewellery and one-of-a-kind find
 s you won't see in the big box stores.\n\n\nDecember 4-6\, 2026 : 388 Car
 law Ave #207\n\nIndoors: 10\,000 sqft industrial exposed brick\, 30' ceil
 ings\n\n__________________________________________\n\n2025 Preview Video:
  https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=OjWD1TVWw8o https://www.youtube.com/watc
 h?v=OjWD1TVWw8o\n\n\n\n\n--Friday\, December 4 – OPENING PARTY: SIP 'N SH
 OP--\n\nKick off the weekend with an elevated holiday night out.\n\n$20 A
 dvance | $30 At Door : Purchase Your Advance Ticket https://www.eventbrit
 e.ca/e/opening-sip-n-shop-13th-annual-leslieville-christmas-pop-up-market
 -tickets-2004780121310\n\n6:00pm - 11:00pm\n\nYour ticket includes:\n\n🥂
  All-Inclusive Drink Tastings\n\n-Sip and savour your way through 50+ win
 es\, spirits\, craft beers\, ready-to-drink options\, and spirit-free bev
 erages.\n\n-Tasting passport included\n\n-Complimentary keepsake glass to
  take home\n\n-Option to purchase your favourite beverages on-site\n\n🍽️
  Food Samplings & Featured Food Vendors\n\n🛍️ Exclusive Pre-Market Shopp
 ing & Discounts Over 50 Vendors\n\n🎧 Live DJ with DJ Spence Diamonds\n\n
 🎅 Visit Santa\n\n🎭 Live Silks Performance by Artist's Play\n\n🏢 Stunni
 ng Industrial-Chic Venue\n\n📸 Holiday Photo Backdrop\n\n🥫 A Percentage 
 of Proceeds Supports Second Harvest | Accepting food donations\n\n_______
 _______________________\n\n\n\n-- SATURDAY - SUNDAY! FREE ENTRY! -- 10am-
 6pm\n\n🛍️ Shop Our Curated Christmas Market: Discover unique gifts and f
 estive finds from 70+ local vendors.\n\n🎅 Visit Santa in the Village spo
 nsored by Crafthaus Renovations\n\n🍽️ Sample & Shop Food Vendors\n\n☕ Co
 mplimentary Hot Chocolate: Daily from 2–5pm! Sponsored by Desjardins Insu
 rance Agents: Tracey Pether & Leane Besky\n\n💌 Santa Letter Writing Work
 shops\n\n🍪Cookie Decorating Workshop\n\n🎧 Live DJ: Enjoy festive beats 
 and classic tunes.\n\n📸 Holiday Photo Backdrop: Snap memorable photos.\n
 \n👩‍🎨 Face Painting\n\n🥫 Accepting Food Donations: Help us support Sec
 ond Harvest by bringing non-perishable food items for those in need.\n\n\
 nFor updates on What's new for 2026\, join our newsletter! https://bit.ly
 /48dYCDL https://bit.ly/48dYCDL\n\nFollow our Instagram:\n\nwww.instagram
 .com/leslievillechristmasmarket http://www.instagram.com/leslievillechris
 tmasmarket\n\nwww.instagram.com/eastsideeventsto http://www.instagram.com
 /eastsideeventsto\n\nMore Information: www.eastsideevents.ca http://www.e
 astsideevents.ca
CATEGORIES:Market,DJ/Club/Rave
