SUMMARY: RISE: ESSEL [Toolroom]
DESCRIPTION:Sat Dec 5: ESSEL [UK]\n3DAH! | SHERA | MIZ MEGS | Melanie Sut
 herland\n\nAdvance Tickets: https://wiggleroomtoronto.com/event/rise-esse
 l-toolroom/\nEarly Wiggler: $25\nThe Wiggler: $30\n\n\nRISE - proper hous
 e music with DJs who know how to move a room.\nBuilt with intention — cre
 ating space\, shifting balance\, and pushing the culture forward without 
 making a spectacle of it.\nWiggle Room is a Safer Dance Space\, where res
 pect on the floor matters as much as what comes through the speakers.\nCo
 me for the music. Stay for the energy.\n~ RISE ~\n\n\nStraight from the U
 K and signed to the iconic Toolroom Records\, ESSEL brings her signature 
 sound and dancefloor energy to Toronto. Get ready for a proper night of b
 ouncy house music!\n\nAdvance Tickets:\nEarly Wiggler: $25\nThe Wiggler: 
 $30\n\nPerformances:\n10-12 Melanie Sutherland\n12-1 Shera\n1-2 ESSEL\n2-
 3 3DAH!\n3-close Miz Megs\n\n\n#WiggleRoomToronto is the #HomeofBouncyBea
 ts\nOptions for prepaid table/ticket packages (ONE ticket = everything me
 ntioned):\n\nTo Arrange Special Packages: wigglyevents@gmail.com mailto:w
 igglyevents@gmail.com (sold separately from admission)\n\nATM on site\nFu
 ll Bar Service\n21+ event\n\nHosted by: 1lvl1 Entertainment\; Wiggly Even
 ts\; Wiggle Room Toronto\; Sunshine Frequencies\; RISE\n\n~ WiGGLE RESPON
 SIBLY ~\nWe have a strict code of conduct and reserve the right to refuse
  anyone at any time. Wiggle Room is a Safer Dance Space. We take this ver
 y seriously. We encourage everyone not to hesitate to bring to our attent
 ion anything you think that we should be made aware of\, such as harassme
 nt\, violation of personal space\, solicitation or use of controlled subs
 tances\, over-intoxicated behaviour\, or anything else that may pose a ri
 sk or discomfort to you or others. You may use the safe word BANANA\, ask
  any of our staff for a Banana\, and we will direct you to a safe\, quiet
  space. Our security staff are in marked clothing. Our team and event hos
 ts\, such as Takin\, Lindsay Fay\, Nour Bawab\, Christina Barron\, Tyler 
 Hill\, Mitch (lead security)\, and Tanya\, are all available.\n\n~ Wiggle
  Wiggle ~\n772 Dundas St West
