DESCRIPTION:Explore the beauty of the Korean Moon Jar and traditional moth
 er-of-pearl craft through a contemporary hands-on art experience. Using ge
 nuine mother-of-pearl pieces\, participants decorate a pre-made Moon Jar f
 orm with their own colour and pattern design\, creating a unique 4 x 4-inc
 h artwork to take home. Beginner-friendly and no previous art experience r
 equired.\nThis program is part of Youth Hub service. Youth Hubs are a welc
 oming place for teens after school and in the summer\, where helpful staff
  are always available. Free\, nutritious snacks are offered daily. Drop 
 by a branch with a\nYouth Hub\nor call the branch to find out more.
LOCATION:Daniel G. Hill\, Youth Hub
