X-SOURCE-URLS:{"Events": "https://events.yorku.ca/events/canadian-writers-in-person-reading-series-ben-ladouceur-i-remember-lights/"}
X-SOURCE-ID:events
SUMMARY:Canadian Writers in Person Reading Series: Ben Ladouceur\, I remem
 ber lights
DTSTART:20261208T130000Z
DTEND:20261209T020000Z
DTSTAMP:20261118T135100Z
UID:MEC-855574f497fe975ae99d6b7d5353c0e8@events.yorku.ca
RECURRENCE-ID:20261208T130000Z
SEQUENCE:2
CATEGORIES:LA&amp\;PS Department of Humanities
CLASS:PUBLIC
CREATED:20261118
DESCRIPTION:Students get up close and personal with an eclectic group of a
 uthors while earning course credit through LA&PS’ Canadian Writers in Pe
 rson (AP/CLTR 1953 6.0A) course. You’ll explore the contemporary work of
  renowned authors\, while having the unique opportunity to engage with the
 m in a dialogue about their work.\nReadings are free and open to members o
 f the public and to members of the York community not enrolled in the cour
 se.\nOur lineups consist of a unique selection of emerging and established
  Canadian writers\, whose writing explores a broad range of topics\, and a
  variety of geographical and cultural landscapes. Featuring seasoned and e
 merging poets and fiction writers\, the series highlights Canada’s ever-
 growing literary talent.\nDecember 8\, 2026 – I Remember Lights\nIn the 
 summer of 1967\, Montreal is buzzing with Expo 67—and for a young man ne
 w to the city\, love and possibility feel endless\, even when being queer 
 is still criminalized. A decade later\, the notorious 1977 police raid on 
 the Truxx gay bar forces him to confront the bitter choice between happine
 ss and safety.\nAward-winning poet Ben Ladouceur’s debut novel I Remembe
 r Lights is an intimate\, unforgettable portrait of queer joy\, desire\, a
 nd resilience in pre-liberation Montreal.\nZoom links on our Canadian Writ
 ers In Person Website: https://www.yorku.ca/laps/huma/canadian-writers/ (
  https://www.yorku.ca/laps/huma/canadian-writers/ )\n
LAST-MODIFIED:20261118
PRIORITY:5
TRANSP:OPAQUE
URL:https://events.yorku.ca/events/canadian-writers-in-person-reading-seri
 es-ben-ladouceur-i-remember-lights/
X-SOURCE:York University
END:VEVENT
