UID:6af9f0704653e9002c384e9f@tpl.bibliocommons.com
DESCRIPTION:In this workshop led by Coach Joshua Watkis\, participants wil
 l explore the core principles that guide poets\, focusing on why poetry is
  written and the meaning behind taking on the poet's mantle. Participants 
 will deeply examine the utility of poetry through lenses of expression\, s
 torytelling\, truth\, creativity\, social commentary and communal impact.\
 nThis program is part of Youth Hub service. Youth Hubs are a welcoming pla
 ce for teens after school and in the summer\, where helpful staff are alwa
 ys available. Free\, nutritious snacks are offered daily. Drop by a bran
 ch with a\nYouth Hub\nor call the branch to find out more.
