DESCRIPTION:Discover and learn about the entire process of creative screen
  printing! Create hand drawn art\, make a silkscreen and then expose your 
 art onto your own silkscreen. Then\, screen print the art onto readymade i
 tems. Participants will learn and do all the basics of photo emulsion scre
 en printing and be inspired to reuse their own existing fabric\, clothing\
 , and textiles!\nRegistration is required.\nSpace is limited. Registrants
 ’ spots will be held until 6:05 PM on the day of the program. Your spot 
 may be forfeit after this time.\nRegistration opens on Friday\, November 2
 0th\, 9 AM.\nInformation Collection Notice:\nThe personal information on t
