SUMMARY:GTApreneurs December 9\, 2026 Afternoon Virtual Business Networkin
 g Event Toronto
DESCRIPTION:Toronto Women in Business Networking Group (TWIB)\n\\*\\*To at
 tend\, please go here to COMPLETE YOUR REGISTRATION: https://gtapreneurs.c
 om/networking-events-toronto\n\nDo you want more clients? Join us for GTAp
 reneurs December 9\, 2026 Afternoon Virtual Business Networking Event to c
 onnect with other amazing entrepreneurs\, learn something new and promote 
 your business!\n\n**EVENT ITINERARY:**\n\n* **[11:45am-12pm: Pre-event net
 working]**\n* **12:00-12:10pm:** GTApreneurs welcoming presentation\n* **1
 2:10-12:30pm:** Featured Speaker Presentation\, ***“The Liaison Officer 
 Service: Helping Small Businesses Get their Taxes Right”***\n* **12:30-1
 :00pm:** Elevator Pitches (45 seconds each)\n* **1:00-1:45pm:** Breakout r
 ooms (Network 1-1 with other guests)\n\n**TICKETS:** Free for everyone\n\n
 \\*Guest Contact sheet will be emailed to you after the event. Note: You m
 ust attend the event to receive the guest contact sheet\n\n**Event Organiz
 er & Host:**\n**Tammy Defoe**\, President and Business Coach\, GTApreneurs
 \nVisit https://gtapreneurs.com/about and https://gtapreneurs.com/business
 -coaching-toronto for more information about Tammy and her Business Coachi
 ng and Consulting services.\n\n**QUESTIONS ABOUT THE EVENT?**\nContact **T
 ammy** at (416) 522-7770 or info@gtapreneurs.com or book a video consultat
 ion with her here: https://calendly.com/gtapreneurs\n\nNot a GTApreneurs M
 ember? Go here to view our memberships and register: https://gtapreneurs.c
 om/business-networking-memberships
URL;VALUE=URI:https://www.meetup.com/downtown-toronto-women-in-business-me
 etup/events/317470032/
