DESCRIPTION:Toronto Women in Business Networking Group (TWIB)\n\\*\\*To at
 tend\, please go here to COMPLETE YOUR REGISTRATION: https://gtapreneurs.c
 om/business-networking-events-ajax\n\nJoin us for an exciting Business Net
 working Event at CASUAL Restaurant\, Pickering Casino Resort on Thursday D
 ecember 10\, 2026 where you can mix n mingle with other friendly entrepren
 eurs and small business owners and engage in 3-minute intervals of Speed N
 etworking! This is an outstanding opportunity for you to meet potential cl
 ients and referral partners and promote your business.\n\nAppetizers provi
 ded. \\*Buy your own beverage and/or meal\n\n* **TIME:** 5:00-8:00pm\n* **
 VENUE:** CASUAL Restaurant\, Pickering Casino Resort\n* **ADDRESS:** 888 D
 urham Live Ave\, Pickering\, ON\n* **PARKING:** Free\, onsite\n\n**EVENT I
 TINERARY:**\n\n* **5:00-5:45pm:** Open Networking + Appetizers (provided) 
 + Buy your own beverage and order your own meal (optional) to be served at
  6:45pm.\n* **5:45-6:45pm:** Speed Networking (In pairs for 3 minutes\, th
 en switch)\n* **6:45-8:00pm:** Open networking + order your own meal (opti
 onal)\n\n**TICKETS:** $20\n\n(Includes Guest Contact Sheet emailed to you 
 the day after the event - if you attend)\n\n**QUESTIONS ABOUT THE EVENT?**
 \nCall or text Tammy at 416-522-7770 or email info@gtapreneurs.com\n\nNot 
 a GTApreneurs Member? Go here to view our memberships and register: https:
 //gtapreneurs.com/business-networking-memberships
