DESCRIPTION:Address:\nCassette\nToronto\, ON\nCanada\n\nSpill some tea at 
 the last Open Ended Storytelling Night of 2026!\nOpen Ended is a hilarious
 \, live game night meets storytelling night where new and old friends come
  together to share cliffhangers\, messy moments\, and unbelievable stories
  Throughout the evening\, guests will be invited to share short stories th
 at end on a cliffhanger — the kind that leaves everyone leaning in\, ask
 ing\, “wait… what happened next?”\nThe night blends a relaxed open m
 ic with table conversation. Each table will receive prompts and story card
 s to spark conversation\, encourage connection\, and get the storytelling 
 flowing…\n\nHosted by Fifth Edit TO
