DESCRIPTION:Join us for a relaxed\, inclusive and inter-generational wellb
 eing concert with musicians from the One Health Partners Arts for Health a
 nd Well-Being Collaborative. Through guided listening\, poetry readings\, 
 gentle movement\, reflection and audience participation\, experience the i
 mpact of music on holistic wellness. Therapy dogs will be on site before a
 nd during the program\, beginning at 2pm.\nThis program is intended for ch
 ildren ages 8 and up\, teens\, and adults. Its relaxed format is designed 
 to welcome different ways of listening\, moving and participating\, includ
 ing the needs of disabled and neurodivergent audience members. Presented i
 n collaboration with One Health Partners.\nInformation Collection Notice:\
 nThe personal information on this form is collected by the Toronto Public 
 Library under the Public Libraries Act\, sections 20(a)\, 20(c)\, and 20(d
 ). The information will only be used for event and program registration\, 
