X-SOURCE-ID:meetup_toronto_20s_to_50s_singles_social
X-SOURCE:Meetup: Toronto 20s-50s Singles Social
UID:event_317436557@meetup.com
SEQUENCE:1
DTSTAMP:20261121T065208Z
DTSTART;TZID=America/Toronto:20261212T190000
DTEND;TZID=America/Toronto:20261212T210000
SUMMARY:Meet New Friends\, 50+ Board Games & After Dark Specials | 25–45
DESCRIPTION:Toronto 20's to 50's Singles Social (4000+)\nDecember is here\
 , the festive season is around the corner\, and it's a great time to get t
 ogether\, have some fun and make new friends! 🎄❤️\n\nLooking to exp
 and your social circle but not sure where to start? Join us at Stout Irish
  Pub for a relaxed\, board-game-led social evening where meeting new peopl
 e happens naturally as you play\, laugh and enjoy the games together.\n\nW
 ith 50+ board games to choose from\, there's always an easy way to join a 
 group\, start chatting and discover people you get along with. And if you 
 need a little help mingling or joining a game\, our host will be there to 
 welcome you\, make introductions and help you feel at ease!\n\n🎟️ Boo
 k Online & Save: [https://toronto12thdec.eventbrite.co.uk](https://toronto
 12thdec.eventbrite.co.uk)\nEarly Bird: CAD $10\nRegular: CAD $15\nAt the D
 oor: CAD $20 cash — payable to host Kruttika\nBooking in advance helps u
 s plan the right space and group size and guarantees your place.\n\n🍻 W
 hat to Expect\n7:00 PM – Welcome & Drinks\nMeet your host\, Kruttika\, g
 rab a drink and settle in.\nComing alone? No problem! Many guests attend s
 olo. Our host will help with introductions and make sure you feel welcome.
 \n🎲 7:30 PM onwards – Board Games & Mingling\nThis is where the fun b
 egins!\n\nChoose from Stout's collection of 50+ board games\, join a table
  and get to know new people as you play. Whether you enjoy strategy games\
 , fun group games or something light-hearted\, there's plenty to choose fr
 om.\nNo need to bring a group or know anyone beforehand. Just find a game\
 , join in and let the conversations happen naturally.\nOur host will be ar
 ound throughout the evening to help you mingle\, introduce you to others a
 nd find a group to join whenever you need a hand.\n🍻 After Dark Special
  \\| 9–11 PM\nMake the most of Stout's After Dark Special\, with $7 beer
 s and $7 highballs\, along with other specials.\n\n❤️ Why Come Along?\
 n✔ Meet over 25 new people in one evening\n✔ 50+ board games to play a
 nd enjoy together\n✔ A fun\, relaxed way to break the ice and make new f
 riends\n✔ Meet people naturally while playing games\n✔ Friendly host t
 o help with introductions and mingling\n✔ Most attendees come solo\n✔ 
 Relaxed Irish pub atmosphere\n✔ Reserved space for our group\n✔ Plenty
  of time for drinks\, games and socialising\n✔ Friendship-focused — no
 t a dating event\n\n👥 Who Is This For?\n✔ Ages 25–45\n✔ New to To
 ronto or long-time locals\n✔ Solo attendees welcome\n✔ Anyone looking 
 to make new friends and expand their social circle\nWe're not a closed gro
 up — new faces are always welcome\, and you don't need to know anyone be
 forehand.\n\n💳 Why We Use Tickets\nYour ticket helps us:\n• Organise 
 the right venue space\n• Support our local hosts\n• Create a more comm
 itted group experience\n• Deliver a well-organised evening for everyone\
 n\n🌍 About Fast Friends\nFor over 10 years\, Fast Friends has been help
 ing people meet new people and build meaningful friendships in 30+ cities 
 around the world.\nOur mission is simple:\nTo make meeting new people easy
 \, relaxed and enjoyable.\nCome for the games. Meet new people as you play
 . Leave with new connections. ❤️
