DESCRIPTION:\nJoin us for a virtual information session for prospective ap
 plicants to the Master of Biotechnology Management (MBM) and Graduate Dipl
 oma in Biotechnology (GDB) programs on Tuesday\, December 15\, 2026\, from
  12:00–1:00 p.m. \n\n\nLearn more about the programs\, including their 
 structure\, curriculum\, and admissions process\, and hear directly from f
 aculty\, administrators\, and current students. You’ll also have the opp
 ortunity to ask questions and learn more about the student experience.\n\n
 \nRegister for the Zoom session here.\n\n\nWe look forward to seeing you t
 here!\n\n\nGraduate Biotechnology Programs\nMarkham Campus | Faculty of Sc
 ience | York University\n\n
