DESCRIPTION:This beginner-friendly Canva class helps you learn how to crea
 te beautiful Christmas cards with ease. Participants will learn how to us
 e Canva templates to design a personalized Christmas card that they can s
 end to friends and family.\nRegistration will start 2 weeks before this cl
 ass. Computers will be provided.\nInformation Collection Notice:\nThe pers
 onal information on this form is collected by the Toronto Public Library u
 nder the Public Libraries Act\, sections 20(a)\, 20(c)\, and 20(d). The in
