DESCRIPTION:Looking for a place to connect with others? Working on a knitt
 ing or crochet project and need advice or suggestions?\nCome and join the 
 Fibre Arts group at Long Branch to get inspiration or just to relax\, work
  on your project and enjoy the company of others and have a cup of tea.\nB
 ring your partner\, tell a friend. Come and join the group.\nThis is a dro
 p in program. Please bring your own yarn and needles for your projects.\nW
 e look forward to seeing you.
