DESCRIPTION:Come join us for a cozy crafting session where we’ll be turn
 ing paper cones into gorgeous\, textured yarn Christmas trees!\nWhether yo
 u want to keep it minimalistic\, make it super colorful\, or load it up wi
 th sparkly decorations\, you’ll leave with your very own handmade holida
 y tree.\nCome enjoy great music\, snacks\, and a relaxed space to hang out
  and get crafty.\nThis program is part of Youth Hub service. Youth Hubs ar
 e a welcoming place for teens after school and in the summer\, where helpf
 ul staff are always available. Free\, nutritious snacks are offered daily
 . Drop by a branch with a\nYouth Hub\nor call the branch to find out more
 .
