UID:6af4beaae2267c00335bbf9e@tpl.bibliocommons.com
DESCRIPTION:Colour and take home a holiday-themed ornament using acrylic
  markers! These models came off our 3D printers. Come ready to unleash y
 our creativity and have a blast!\nRegistration is required and begins Dece
 mber 8\, 2026 at 12:30pm.  Please note that your spot is guaranteed only 
 for the first 5 minutes of the class.\nInformation Collection Notice:\nThe
  personal information\n on this form is collected by the Toronto Public Li
 brary under the \nPublic Libraries Act\, sections 20(a)\, 20(c)\, and 20(d
 ). The information \nwill only be used for event and program registration\
 , delivery and \nevaluation. Questions about how the library handles your 
 information can\n be directed to Answerline staff at\nanswerline@tpl.ca\n\
 , 416-397-5981\, 789 Yonge Street\, Toronto ON M4W 2G8.
