DESCRIPTION:Though the weather outside might be frightful\, spending time 
 with friends is always delightful!  Get into the holiday spirit by spendi
 ng an hour or two laughing\, chatting\, and decorating gingerbread houses 
 with your fellow graduate students.  Delicious treats and warm drinks wil
 l be provided.\nPlease register using the following link:\nComplete the Re
 gistration Form\n
