SUMMARY: Depeche Mode - Toronto celebrates 46 years of music for the mass
 es
DESCRIPTION:We'll run through ALL the bigs hit a in a crazy fun-filled tw
 o hours! SATURDAY / Boxing Day.\n\nEarly show - 5pm! FREE.\n\n\nImmerse y
 ourself in the BIG SCREEN / BIG SOUND fun + join a whole pub full of othe
 r Depeche Mode fans! FANTASTIC food and drink specials.\n\n\nDOOR PRIZES 
 - win Collector Edition Framed album cover art - from all 15 studio album
 s! (see below)\n\n\nDEPECHE MODE VIDEO TRIBUTE DAY – BOXING DAY IN TORONT
 O!\n\nBoxing Day just got legendary! Escape the post-Christmas haze and i
 mmerse yourself in the dark\, electrifying world of Depeche Mode with an 
 early VIDEO tribute spectacular in Toronto.\n\nRelive the groundbreaking 
 visuals\, iconic music videos\, and timeless anthems that made them legen
 ds — from "Just Can't Get Enough" to "Enjoy the Silence\," "Personal Jesu
 s\," and beyond.\n\nBig screens\, killer sound\, and a room full of devot
 ed fans singing every word. It’s a full-on synth-pop celebration you won’
 t want to miss!Toronto |December 26th | Turn Boxing Day into Mode Day.\n\
 nGrab your friends\, wear your best black\, and let the music take contro
 l. Who’s ready to Violate the Silence? See you there!\n\n\nVIDEO SONG LIS
