URL:https://tockify.com/torevent/detail/25771/1798772400000
SUMMARY: DAYDREAMS NYE
DESCRIPTION:DAYDREAMS returns this New Year’s Eve\, bringing together Chi
 cago’s Mark Grusane and hometown hero DJ Dirty Dale for a night where mus
 ic leads\, time disappears\, and the dreams we’ve carried become the worl
 d we create.\n\nMARK GRUSANE (Chicago)\n\nA Chicago treasure whose relati
 onship with the dancefloor stretches back to the ‘80s\, Mark Grusane is a
  lifelong digger\, producer\, and co-founder of the legendary Mr. Peabody
  Records. With an encyclopedic knowledge of house\, disco\, and the music
 al worlds beyond\, Mark has a rare instinct for what makes people move. H
 is selections weave together obscure discoveries\, timeless grooves\, and
  unexpected diversions\, creating deeply emotional journeys guided by a l
 ifetime of musical curiosity and passion.\n\nDIRTY DALE (Toronto)\n\nA fi
 xture in Toronto’s underground house community for over 25 years\, Dirty 
 Dale brings a dancer’s sensibility and a deep love for the groove to ever
 ything he plays. Rooted in the city’s soulful house tradition\, his sound
  moves through deep\, jazzy\, Afro-influenced\, and disco rhythms\, blend
 ing forgotten gems with contemporary cuts. His selections reflect a lifet
 ime spent on both sides of the decks and an enduring devotion to the danc
 efloor.\n\nDAYDREAMS\n\nThere’s something so beautiful about a room full 
 of people surrendering to the same rhythm. Strangers become friends\, tim
 e slips away\, and for a few hours\, nothing matters but the music and th
 e people sharing it.\n\nCome dance and daydream with us as we conjure a f
 uture rooted in harmony\, soulful connection\, and the profound power of 
 love. 💫✨❤️\n\nIG: @the_shephard_scale
CATEGORIES:DJ/Club/Rave,The-Jama,1.4-Hertz
X-TKF-FEATURED-IMAGE:https://d3flpus5evl89n.cloudfront.net/6755f3e6a02aaf
 1c2599e757/6b0097a6e337296d233e244c/scaled_1024.jpg
X-TKF-CUSTOM-PREVIEW:DAYDREAMS returns this New Year’s Eve\, bringing tog
 ether Chicago’s Mark Grusane and hometown hero DJ Dirty Dale for a night 
 where music leads\, time...
