DESCRIPTION:Settlers of Catan is a luck based board game where you manage 
 resources to build your own empire. Learn something new and discuss the cu
 ltural perspective of board games.\nNo registration required but space is 
 limited. Ages 13 - 17.\nThis program is part of Youth Hub service. Youth H
 ubs are a welcoming place for teens after school and in the summer\, where
  helpful staff are always available. Free\, nutritious snacks are offered 
 daily. Drop by a branch with a\nYouth Hub\nor call the branch to find out 
 more.
