SUMMARY:Movies From Around the World
DTSTART;TZID=America/Toronto:20270111T173000
DTEND;TZID=America/Toronto:20270111T200000
UID:69bc63824dacf581ff8330eb@tpl.bibliocommons.com
DESCRIPTION:Join us every second Monday of the month (unless specified oth
 erwise) as we bring the world to you through the power of cinema! Beginnin
 g with a small introduction\, we will be hosting screenings from various m
 ovies from around the world\, so we hope to see you there!\nDecember 14th:
 \nBabette's feast\n(Denmark)\; Runtime: 1h43m\; Rating: G\nJanuary 11th:\n
 The worst person in the world\n(Norway)\; Runtime: 2h8m\; Rating: 14A\nFeb
 ruary 8th:\nMoonlight\n(United States)\; Runtime: 1h51m\; Rating: 14A\nMar
 ch 8th:\nSpider-man\n: Into the Spider-verse (organizer favourite)\; Runti
 me: 1h57m\; Rating: PG
LOCATION:Lillian H. Smith\, Basement program room
URL:https://tpl.bibliocommons.com/v2/events/69bc63824dacf581ff8330eb
X-SOURCE:Toronto Public Library — Adults
END:VEVENT
