DTSTART;TZID=America/Toronto:20270113T100000
DTEND;TZID=America/Toronto:20270113T113000
UID:6afccc11ec8cc5003a24ab34@tpl.bibliocommons.com
DESCRIPTION:Join us for a fun and engaging trivia session featuring a vari
 ety of interesting topics and categories! Put your knowledge to the test w
 ith questions covering foods of the world\, geography\, entertainment\, ge
 neral knowledge\, and much more.\nChallenge yourself\, learn something new
 \, and enjoy some friendly competition in a relaxed and welcoming environm
 ent. Whether you're a trivia enthusiast or just looking for a fun way to s
 ocialize\, there's something for everyone!\nRegister online Drop-ins welco
 me
LOCATION:Malvern\, Community Room
