DESCRIPTION:Families are invited to explore music and stories in this inte
 ractive program! Each session features songs\, movement\, and opportunitie
 s to touch\, play\, and discover various musical instruments. Program is r
 un by Community Music School of Toronto and will be opened with a story by
  Downsview Library staff.\nParents/guardians are required to be in attenda
 nce.\nAges 0-6\nCommunity Music Schools of Toronto is a registered charity
  that gives children and youth a rich and rewarding music and social educa
 tion\, by removing the financial obstacle.
LOCATION:Downsview\, Auditorium (lower level)
