 his is the rambunctious\, ridiculous and totally true story of how the Min
 ions conquered Hollywood\, became movie stars\, lost everything\, unleashe
 d monsters onto the world and then banded together to try and save the pla
 net from the mayhem they had just created. (2026\, 90 min. G)\nFor childre
 n 4 and up with their caregivers.\nDrop in. Space is limited\; entry is gr
 anted on a first come first served basis.\nDaycares and Camps\, please cal
 l 416-393-7720 to inquire.
