SUMMARY:Make Your Own Play Dough
DTSTART;TZID=America/Toronto:20270116T140000
DTEND;TZID=America/Toronto:20270116T150000
UID:6b00cc7469e1ca1858497c09@tpl.bibliocommons.com
DESCRIPTION:Get ready to stir\, squish\, and play! Join us for a do-it-you
 rself play dough-making program where you will learn how to make a fun and
  squishy dough with just a couple of ingredients and hot water. Participan
 ts will be able to choose what colour to make their dough and will take ho
 me the finished product. All materials will be provided. Get ready to get
  creative and a little messy!\nThis program is for ages 5 to 8 years old.\
 nInformation Collection Notice:\nThe personal information on this form is 
 collected by the Toronto Public Library under the Public Libraries Act\, s
 ections 20(a)\, 20(c)\, and 20(d). The information will only be used for e
 vent and program registration\, delivery and evaluation. Questions about h
 ow the library handles your information can be directed to Answerline staf
 f at\nanswerline@tpl.ca\n\, 416-397-5981\, 789 Yonge Street\, Toronto ON M
 4W 2G8.
LOCATION:Don Mills\, Lower level program room.
URL:https://tpl.bibliocommons.com/v2/events/6b00cc7469e1ca1858497c09
X-SOURCE:Toronto Public Library — School Age
END:VEVENT
