SUMMARY:Save the Egg 1 - 4
DTSTART;TZID=America/Toronto:20270118T160000
DTEND;TZID=America/Toronto:20270118T170000
UID:6af3bb759bd80b0045189f06@tpl.bibliocommons.com
DESCRIPTION:Join us for a 4 session workshop where you will be in groups o
 f 2 to design a 3d printed cages to save your Egg from a ladder drop. Each
  session builds towards a championship finale:\nSession 1 : Learn the Tink
 erCad Basics and partner pairing (Digital Innovation Hub)\nSession 2 : Des
 ign and 3D print your cages (Digital Innovation Hub)\nSession 3 : Test Dr
 op and redesign (Community room /Digital Innovation Hub)\nSession 4 : Fin
 al competition and winner crowned (Community Room)\nAges 10 -12\nRegistrat
 ion begins 2 weeks before class.
LOCATION:Malvern\, Digital Innovation /Community room
URL:https://tpl.bibliocommons.com/v2/events/6af3bb759bd80b0045189f06
X-SOURCE:Toronto Public Library — School Age
END:VEVENT
