DESCRIPTION:Your next opportunity could be waiting for you at Career Fair 
 for All!\nAt the biggest York University career fair of the year\, meet em
 ployers who are actively recruiting for a variety of co-op\, internship\, 
 volunteer\, full-time and on-campus jobs. Explore specialized areas design
 ed to help you discover opportunities aligned with your interests and care
 er goals\, and get personalized support through on-the-spot 1:1 resume rev
 iews and career counselling.\nWhether you’re looking for your first job\
 , exploring career possibilities or ready to make your next move\, there
 ’s something here for you.\nThis event is hosted at York University’s 
 Keele Campus. \nRegister Here [icon name=”chevron-right” class=”sma
 ll pl-2″]\nTo register as a student\, you must log on to Experience York
  ( https://yorku-csm.symplicity.com/ ) with your Passport York credentials
 .\n
