 \, 3D modeling\, and introductory robotics coding.\nThis program is for yo
 uth in grades 6-12.\nIt is highly recommended to attend each session to b
 uild on your learning.\nPlease register online.
LOCATION:Fairview\, Room 201\, 2nd floor
