SUMMARY:playGround Festival 2027
DTSTART:20270207T003000Z
DTEND:20270213T020000Z
DTSTAMP:20261118T190600Z
UID:MEC-20c26296a2b1def8331cd4c4a604dd41@events.yorku.ca
RECURRENCE-ID:20270207T003000Z
SEQUENCE:22
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://events.yorku.ca/wp-content/uploads/2026/
 11/banner.jpg
CATEGORIES:School of the Arts, Media, Performance &amp\; Design
CLASS:PUBLIC
CREATED:20261118
DESCRIPTION:playGround Festival is York’s annual student-run theatre fes
 tival dedicated to giving emerging artists within the York community the o
 pportunity to conceptualize\, develop\, and present new and original work.
  For 35 years\, the playGround Festival has served as a creative outlet fo
 r hundreds of participants to take on all the roles that go into organizin
 g the event\, while receiving hands-on experience in the process. Students
  take on roles as playwrights\, dramaturgs\, actors\, designers\, crew and
  stage managers.\nLOCATION: Joseph G Green Studio Theatre ( https://facili
 ties.ampd.yorku.ca/facilities/joseph-g-green-studio-theatre/ )\nDATES: Feb
 ruary 6 – 12\, 2027\nTICKETS – Students: $ 15.00\nAdvanced (until Fri
 day Feb 5th): $ 20.00\nRegular Tickets: $ 25.00 | Box Office: 416.736.5888
 \nSERIES A\nFebruary 6 – 7:30 p.m.\nFebruary 9 – 7:30 p.m.\nFebruary 1
 1 – 7:30 p.m.\nSERIES B\nFebruary 7 – 7:30 p.m.\nFebruary 10 – 7:30 
 p.m.\nFebruary 12 –  7:30 p.m.\nDoors Open: 7:00 p.m.\n
LAST-MODIFIED:20261118
LOCATION:Joe G. Green Theatre\, Centre for Film and Theatre @ York Univers
 ity\, 4700 Keele Street\, Toronto\, ON
PRIORITY:5
TRANSP:OPAQUE
URL:https://events.yorku.ca/events/playground-festival-2027/
X-SOURCE:York University
END:VEVENT
