SUMMARY:Monday Book Club
DTSTART;TZID=America/Toronto:20270208T140000
DTEND;TZID=America/Toronto:20270208T150000
UID:6aea437b8389bd86bfa462ad@tpl.bibliocommons.com
DESCRIPTION:This is a monthly book club that reads contemporary fiction an
 d nonfiction.\nPlease phone the Yorkville branch to be added to the waitin
 g list.\nInformation Collection Notice:\nThe personal information on this 
 form is collected by the Toronto Public Library under the Public Libraries
  Act\, sections 20(a)\, 20(c)\, and 20(d). The information will only be us
 ed for event and program registration\, delivery and evaluation. Questions
  about how the library handles your information can be directed to Answerl
 ine staff at\nanswerline@tpl.ca\n\, 416-397-5981\, 789 Yonge Street\, Toro
 nto ON M4W 2G8.
LOCATION:Yorkville\, Art Gallery
URL:https://tpl.bibliocommons.com/v2/events/6aea437b8389bd86bfa462ad
