DTEND;TZID=America/Toronto:20270209T150000
UID:6aee3ca3035faf0033e1e5f7@tpl.bibliocommons.com
DESCRIPTION:Celebrate the warmth and joy of Valentine’s Day through art!
  In this creative adult program\, participants will decorate a canvas with
  colourful buttons and mixed-media materials to create a charming\, one-of
 -a-kind piece. This fun and relaxing activity encourages imagination\, sel
 f-expression\, and connection while celebrating love\, friendship\, and ki
 ndness.\nThis is a Drop-In program for Adults and Seniors.\nNo registratio
 n required.\nSpace is limited. All materials are provided.
