X-SOURCE-URLS:{"Events": "https://events.yorku.ca/events/black-inclusion-historic-and-current-efforts-to-dismantle-anti-black-racism-dismantling-anti-black-racism/"}
X-SOURCE-ID:events
SUMMARY:Black Inclusion: Historic and Current Efforts to Dismantle Anti-Bl
 ack Racism (Dismantling Anti-Black Racism)
DTSTART:20270211T150000Z
DTEND:20270211T163000Z
DTSTAMP:20260923T184100Z
UID:MEC-50af2a04ae2938f4c8c90e1d37968dc1@events.yorku.ca
RECURRENCE-ID:20270211T150000Z
SEQUENCE:2
CATEGORIES:Equity, Diversity &amp\; Inclusion,Equity, People &amp\; Cultur
 e
CLASS:PUBLIC
CREATED:20260923
DESCRIPTION:This session will follow the birth and development of anti-Bla
 ck racism both globally and locally\, and the historic and on-going effort
 s to dismantle it. Through case-studies and scenarios\, participants will 
 be offered tools and examples of how to respond to anti-Black racism in ef
 fective and sustainable ways.\n
LAST-MODIFIED:20260923
LOCATION:https://yulearn.yorku.ca/local/yulearn/learning_opportunity.php?i
 d=1396
PRIORITY:5
TRANSP:OPAQUE
URL:https://events.yorku.ca/events/black-inclusion-historic-and-current-ef
 forts-to-dismantle-anti-black-racism-dismantling-anti-black-racism/
