 rs\, musicians and authors\, and will be guided through an inspiring crea
 tive journey.\nIn this program\, we focus on:\nBuilding confidence\nDevelo
 ping friends\nIncluding everyone\nSharing ideas\nExpanding creativity\nLim
 ited space available. Register online.\nFor children ages 9-12.\nInformati
 on Collection Notice:\nThe personal information on this form is collected 
