X-SOURCE-ID:tpl_adults
SUMMARY:Coffee and Conversation
DTSTART;TZID=America/Toronto:20270216T093000
DTEND;TZID=America/Toronto:20270216T110000
UID:6acfbd17901b02002cc2679a@tpl.bibliocommons.com
DESCRIPTION:Enjoy some light refreshments\, and informal discussion about 
 services in the neighbourhood. Get to know your local library staff and le
 t us know what information and resources you would like to access at the l
 ibrary and in the community.\nEach month we will be joined by a different 
 community organization. For this February event we are welcoming staff fr
 om the\nOmbudsman Toronto\noffice to introduce themselves and the free ser
 vices they offer to individuals and families in our community.\nSnacks an
 d refreshments are provided for all participants. Ingredient lists will be
  available at the program.
LOCATION:Malvern\, New Programming Space
URL:https://tpl.bibliocommons.com/v2/events/6acfbd17901b02002cc2679a
X-SOURCE:Toronto Public Library — Adults
END:VEVENT
