X-SOURCE-ID:tpl_preschool
SUMMARY:Baby Time
DTSTART;TZID=America/Toronto:20270216T100000
DTEND;TZID=America/Toronto:20270216T110000
UID:6b00c9f90ad4ed003a04c54f@tpl.bibliocommons.com
DESCRIPTION:Bouncing and tickling rhymes\, songs\, and stories for babies 
 birth to 18 months with their parents or caregivers.\nBaby Time\nruns fro
 m 10 to 10:30 am. Children\, parents and caregivers are invited to\nStay a
 nd Play\n\, from 10:30 to 11 am.\nStay and Play\nprovides a welcoming spac
 e for children to play and learn while caregivers connect with each other 
 and library staff.\nDrop-in. No registration required.
LOCATION:Don Mills\, Lower level program room.
URL:https://tpl.bibliocommons.com/v2/events/6b00c9f90ad4ed003a04c54f
X-SOURCE:Toronto Public Library — Preschool
END:VEVENT
