 ths to 3 years\, with their parents or caregivers.\nToddler Time\nruns fro
 m 10 to 10:30 am. Children\, parents and caregivers are invited to\nStay a
 nd Play\n\, from 10:30 to 11 am.\nStay and Play\nprovides a welcoming spac
 e for children to play and learn while caregivers connect with each other 
 and library staff.\nDrop-in. No registration required.\nNOTE: No program o
 n Wednesday September 30 for National Day of Truth and Reconciliation.
