 ilable) followed by a social gathering afterwards\, this program offers so
 mething for all. Board games\, cards\, arts/crafts or just interesting con
 versation are always available. Light refreshments and healthy snacks are 
 served.Day:Tuesdays and ThursdaysTime:6 pm – 8 pmPlace:Scadding Court CC
 \, Pool & Room 1
LOCATION:Scadding Court Community Centre\, 707 Dundas Street West\, Toront
 o
