 creen. Whether you're a first-time viewer or long-time fan\, these movies 
 are sure to please.\nNovember 19: Forrest Gump (1994\, PG)\nNovember 26: 
 The Shawshank Redemption (1994\, 14A)\nDecember 3: Die Hard (1988\, 18A)\
 nDecember 10: Big (1988\, PG)\nDecember 17: The Holdovers (2023\, 14A)\
 nAll are welcome. Drop-in\, no registration required.
