 1c2599e757/6afc87b1eb5bf621392af5ac/scaled_1024.jpg
X-TKF-CUSTOM-PREVIEW:Prince Rogers Nelson — the Purple One\, the Genius o
 f Paisley Park\, the man who could make a guitar weep and a crowd lose th
 eir minds with a single glance —...
